[{"client_msg_id":"b8af26b6-a9d7-4931-9786-196a2c31ee91","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"wasm 用のプロジェクトなので、gopls を GOOS 指定で起動することにしました","ts":"1616238674.105200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9ril"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3ae9637-9024-489d-97e6-866f8c2eeb6c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"gopls を諦めるということで決着つけました","ts":"1616238583.104500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WBokb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ea44b29-4b71-4fb8-b5bd-3617006e09eb","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```{\n  \"gopls\" : {\n    \"cmd\": [\"set GOOS=js \u0026amp;\u0026amp;\", \"gopls\"]\n  }\n}```\n強引な設定","ts":"1616238578.104400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4tDNa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb544a1e-ae27-4d9f-8ba3-5590ecb81784","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分は割と OS ごとに違う実装のコードが必要なものをかいてますけど","ts":"1616238576.104100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aEXzp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdf7b888-b22b-4f43-b2f5-4d8fbc236c7f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"寿司テム","ts":"1616238556.103500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jMQx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bee2df3-f010-4cb1-b5ee-a6568fa0cad8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、スシテム個別の部分を実装するのは必要で、そういう人たちがgoplsをどう手懐けてるかは知りたいですね","ts":"1616238457.103200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"he5D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a96b095a-7372-4ed2-8b1f-8d06189c5e94","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そもそもGoとして、特定のOSに特化した処理(下回りではなく)があるっていうのは、想定される開発スタイルなんだろうか\nこれ自体というよりは、syscall/jsが上で必要になるか、みたいな意味で","ts":"1616238421.102500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hB3V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fe4cb95-e1b1-4558-9fd1-c56ab4140b02","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"んー 環境変数は cmd とかでやるしかないかな？","ts":"1616237997.101400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SPz9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8193c7b-1d6e-411a-bce6-a5d8b1fb0508","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`settings.json` でやれること\n```    cmd (List ex: ['clangd-6.0', '-enable-snippets'])\n    initialization_options (Dictionary)\n    whitelist (List)\n    blacklist (List)\n    config (Dictionary)\n    workspace_config (Dictionary)\n    disabled (Boolean)\n    root_uri (String)\n    root_uri_patterns (List)\n    semantic_highlight (Dictionary)```","ts":"1616237974.100900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rxt1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a718a17c-64e0-419f-9de1-9b30c4ed80d4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"最大公約数的アプローチだと厳しい…","ts":"1616237879.100400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fb93"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f98a1eef-394e-477c-bde5-6779e512cf4a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それぞれ片方でエラーになるので、なにも許容してくれない結果返したりして","ts":"1616237837.099900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"defeW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88b35373-a597-4fea-86af-802f53b74f0d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"GOOS=js なときとそうでないとき両方が混在","ts":"1616237795.099500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U2UJZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d7186ca-94b1-4e7a-a522-4483a9c5248b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"エディタ、 GOOS については量子重ね合わせ的な解釈 (?)をして欲しいという気持ちがある","ts":"1616237782.099100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false